{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "52460583cffeb4a45068ce38a6eac48e4dec21af9c4786ad054e06ba53e6fb8b", "ja": "（昨日から仕事で、温泉旅館にやってきている。\nそして今日は完全なオフ。温泉をたっぷり楽しもう！）", "zh": "（昨天因为工作来到温泉旅馆，\n然后今天一整天都放假，就来好好享受一下温泉吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1001_p", "source_sha256": "746256da4a385a09f4e82487b213dbf7c9cf3475b479cd6fcd700d5ac2654660", "ja": "（…と思っていたのだが、早朝の露天風呂で瑞希と対面\nする大事件が発生した。寝ぼけて男湯に入ったらしい）", "zh": "（……我原本是这么打算的，不过一早就发生在露天温泉\n撞见瑞希的大事件。她好像是睡昏头而误入男汤。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8f2a86aaaec9ec50ad64e330f7c3c05ec5621b96a15fcc215ae378469cc484f0", "ja": "（幸い他に誰もいなかったので「これは夢だ」と言い\n聞かせつつ、部屋に戻したが……納得してるだろうか）", "zh": "（幸好那时没有其他人，于是我一边告诉她「这是在\n做梦」，一边把她送回房间……不知道她有没有相信。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "56688ffdb3984db03e439c10c310d4f8c312498d0228cc31e25f6d4a87aebf49", "ja": "あ……{$P$}。\nおはようございます。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}。\n早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1004_p", "source_sha256": "93868abf6583d3d47aae8b6075121c2f8413f401dfdfc3656681d4617c317649", "ja": "あっ……。お、おはよう、瑞希……。\nど、どうしたんだ？　寝てたんじゃないのか？", "zh": "啊……早、早安，瑞希……\n怎、怎么了？你不是还在睡吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "431f910018bbf512c9733ec757714e537f01e61d422c9093e23edcc8dbc598ee", "ja": "はい、おそらく寝ていたと思うのですが……\n朝風呂に入る夢を見て、目が覚めました。", "zh": "嗯，我应该是在睡觉没有错……\n不过我梦见自己早上来泡温泉，接着就醒来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "e00a22dab17c11fe9435994420bb8afe4769a5b47fd0e06e1719f24ac12e1447", "ja": "せっかくなので、本当に朝風呂に入ろうと思って、\n来てみたのですが……。", "zh": "既然有机会到这里来，\n我想说不如就真的来泡一下，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "0c6344323bb63a928324f47032b7af234e12c4bc9828256831916f5f230e272f", "ja": "なぜでしょう。今、とてもデジャビュを感じています。\n朝風呂と{$P$}と、私……。", "zh": "不知道为什么，眼前这一幕让我非常有既视感。\n早上的温泉跟{$P$}，还有我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2d29ed4ddbc763582306278a3d064844acbe1ab6fd01b021950729964e0bed01", "ja": "そ、そうなのか。\nなぜだろうな……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？\n为什么呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "9a67340a43db3c92a9537c1ae02419f66b35192e611bd3500d67e4251c690e90", "ja": "……もしかして、{$P$}も\nデジャビュを感じていますか？", "zh": "……难不成{$P$}\n对现在这个状况，也有既视感吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f12d0fc86e337a2bcf62a85db0b710333e382ee3966a5309e849904848dbe3b0", "ja": "ま、まあ……ちょっと。\nいや、不思議なこともあるもんだ。ははは！", "zh": "呃、嗯……有一点。\n哎，有时就是会发生这种神奇的事嘛，哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "e4eb51d9b52668d255db4f78263b98231202e0fce6d2e022c223ee9e090aab4e", "ja": "そうですか……。{$P$}も、\n私とよく似た夢を見たのかもしれません。", "zh": "这样啊……说不定{$P$}\n也做了跟我差不多的梦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "3dd739f20c5024e650aae60559f12ecc67af410110d0a8dd0f4357aaa0b90e7f", "ja": "では、{$P$}も、\nドキドキしていますか？", "zh": "这么说，\n{$P$}现在也很紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c47807e46c20d14bfd5c1cc198f00fc6114bb52d8729e84caa08318277624682", "ja": "えっ？　どうしてまた？", "zh": "咦？为什么这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "7969b55b46ed71edc1015c57183e21ced7c418306d941c83308f73dce55762de", "ja": "私は、目が覚めるとドキドキしていました。\n私が見た夢は、とてもドキドキする夢だったようです。", "zh": "我醒来时，感到心跳非常快。\n看来我做了一个相当令人紧张的梦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "6e6ddb2a6f4022433e2806ed0ccece9540a9bfe6d8cce392b09c01c8200020b1", "ja": "……そして、先ほどから{$P$}も\nどこか、ドキドキしているように見えます。", "zh": "……然后从刚刚开始，\n{$P$}看起来似乎也有点紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "6a1f2b79bdee55077ff6c2fe885ee8c6b29f89b92c3b468bf86b0a7d0adb0539", "ja": "……ドキドキ、していますか？", "zh": "……你现在很紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_1017", "source_sha256": "f4acaf644a1a3a07f6a69c834c330444b5b05d3d3046cb9baeb98e2e976f3b46", "ja": "ドキドキ", "zh": "（心跳不已）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0b66496aec059caaf0cef43e2055cf138fd2585d9a0f86e6c60c6bd80d049fd8", "ja": "どうも、してるみたいだ。\n不思議なこともあるもんだな。", "zh": "好像有一点耶。\n还真是不可思议呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_2001_044miz", "source_sha256": "23faa85574bef4ccdb06272613993b8d266fa7b087e2797d59b239f3e2ff8f55", "ja": "そうですか……。はっ。", "zh": "是这样吗……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_2002_044miz", "source_sha256": "0ac3710b4ff776eaf44ec3aff42204c3de1e8271977b36e311ea775660e88694", "ja": "それを聞いて、なぜか、うれしい気持ちになりました。\nますます不思議です。……夢でのぼせたのか、瑞希？", "zh": "不知道为什么，你这么说让我觉得好开心。\n真是越来越神奇了……难道是在梦中泡晕了吗，瑞希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0113_2003_p", "source_sha256": "b2a99ec36cd54f807018aa6da0d0df68fbea282decce275ab3477bfa0589c44f", "ja": "（すっかり悩ませてしまったらしいが……。\n楽しい思い出には、なってくれそうだな）", "zh": "（好像害她陷入苦恼了……\n不过，这似乎也会成为一段快乐的回忆。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
